  "bodyHash": "8745a2863168cad7",
  "content": "\n\n請提供需要翻譯的文字。\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Discord&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"117\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://x.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Twitter&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=x&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"116\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@heyitsfuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=YouTube&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"118\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=GitHub&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"108\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=CurseForge&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"143\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Fuzs\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Modrinth&amp;color=ECEBE6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"129\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/about.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">《終界動物學》將以驚險的方式為你的世界帶來全新的刺激與危險！正面迎戰兇猛的新型生物，例如狡黠的終界迷你人、致命的墮落騎士以及詭譎的凋靈女巫——每種都散發出獨特的混沌氣息。探索白雪覆蓋的森林，在噬狼的追捕下求生，並運用貓頭鷹的力量飛躍於下方的危機之上。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">製作傳送炸彈、調製詛咒藥水，並解鎖能扭轉戰局的附魔，如靈魂綁定與驅逐，保護自己免受這些敵對新威脅的侵害。隨著新生物、致命戰利品與令人驚嘆的效果，世界每個角落都隱藏著恐怖之事——每次冒險都承諾著新的挑戰。準備好迎接一個危險不再只是窺視你……而是正在向你逼近的世界吧。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/features.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌌 新增生物</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧍‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界迷你人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：體型嬌小但極其兇猛！這些小型終界人攻擊力驚人，而且最愛追逐</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">震盪苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">💥 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">震盪苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：爆炸時不會破壞方塊，反而會把你傳送到別處！掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷惑粉</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，可用於製作特殊 TNT 變體。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">墮落騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：致命的不死戰士，有時還會騎乘邪惡坐騎！擊敗他們即可獲得強力的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">狩獵弓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐎 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">墮落坐騎</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：被墮落騎士騎乘的兇猛殭屍馬！治癒它後，就能騎上屬於你自己的暗黑駿馬！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧙‍♀️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋靈女巫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：邪惡的女巫，會施加凋靈效果！擊敗她們即可用枯萎塵釀造強大的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衰敗藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐱 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋靈貓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：可愛？再想想。這些兇狠的貓咪會保護凋靈女巫，並且出擊迅速！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧟‍♂️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">寄生殭屍</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：終界人與殭屍的混合體，攻擊時會把你傳送走！稀有掉落下獨特的附魔書。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🐺 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">噬狼</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：雪地森林變得更加危險了！小心它們發光的紅眼睛！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🦉 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">貓頭鷹</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：友善的森林夥伴，會主動攻擊蜘蛛。掉落</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">貓頭鷹蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，可用於釀造</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">昇騰藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🛠️ 新增物品</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🎇 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷惑粉</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：製作強力傳送主題炸彈！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">震盪苦力怕</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">枯萎塵</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：釀造強效</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衰敗藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，扭轉戰局！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋靈女巫</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">狩獵弓</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：可使用弓與弩的升級附魔進行附魔，如快速裝填與多重射擊。由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">墮落騎士</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">稀有掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">✨ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界碎片</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：組合起來即可合成你自己的</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界珍珠</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">終界迷你人</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掉落。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🥚 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">貓頭鷹蛋</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：釀造</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">昇騰藥水</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，飛翔天際！由</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">貓頭鷹</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">掉落。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 新增附魔</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">📜 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">靈魂綁定</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：死亡後保留物品，但觸發時等級可能會下降。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⚔️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衰敗</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> 與 🏹 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">凋靈</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：對目標施加致命的凋靈效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🚪 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">驅逐</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：當你受到攻擊時，會將攻擊者傳送離開，模仿寄生殭屍的詭計！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🧪 新增藥水</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌀 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">位移</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：隨機將實體傳送離開。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🖤 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衰敗</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：施加致命的凋靈效果。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🤯 </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">迷惑</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：施加暈眩效果使敵人失去方向感。</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🕊️ </span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">昇騰</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">：賦予漂浮能力，讓你飛升空中。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/media.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/1.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/3.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/4.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/5.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/media/6.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/installation.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需要安裝於客戶端 &amp; 伺服器端必需</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/puzzles-lib\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">PUZZLES LIB</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric 與 NeoForge）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/fabric-api\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FABRIC API</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">⏩ </span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">需安裝 </span></strong><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/forge-config-api-port\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">FORGE CONFIG API PORT</span></strong></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"> （Fabric）</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/configuration.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若該模組支援，可直接透過遊戲內的模組選單進行設定（Fabric 版需安裝由</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Prospector\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Prospector</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">開發的</span><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/modmenu\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mod Menu</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">）。請注意，在較舊的 Minecraft 版本中，還必須安裝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Forge Config Screens</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">若使用外部文字編輯器進行手動設定，所有檔案皆位於</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">.minecraft/config</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">資料夾內，檔名分別為</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-client.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">、</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-common.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">或</span><code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">MOD_ID-server.toml</span></code><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，取決於設定檔類型。並非所有類型都會存在，甚至可能完全沒有。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/headers/credits.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"32\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">非常感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/crazypants_mc_the_second\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">CrazyPants</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">的</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ender-zoo\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ender Zoo</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">模組，我十分喜愛它，也非常期待能將其帶回現代版的 Minecraft 並獻給新一代玩家。絕大多數程式碼皆為原創改寫，因此特別像是生物行為等部分會與舊版模組有所不同。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">🌟 </span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">衷心感謝</span><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/tamlighter\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Tamlighter</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">創作所有精彩的新貼圖。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ytones\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/ytones/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/easy-shulker-boxes\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/easyshulkerboxes/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/enchanting-infuser\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enchantinginfuser/banner.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/discord\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/commons/studio.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fuzss/modresources/main/pages/data/enderzoology/strip.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
